@startuml AD4_Worker_Report_Submission
title AD4 — Worker Report Submission (with photos)

start
:Worker opens Report tab;
:Fill issue + sensor ID + notes;

if (Attach visuals?) then (yes)
  if (Source?) then (camera)
    :Take photo (ImageSource.camera);
  else (gallery)
    :Pick images (pickMultiImage);
  endif
  :Show thumbnails (removable);
else (no)
endif

if (Issue filled and valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Fix fields;
  -> re-validate;
endif

:Upload images to Firebase Storage\n(reports/{id}/image_n.jpg, 70% JPEG);
:Push report {issue, sensorId,\nnotes, imageUrls} to TANK_01/reports;
:Admin web Receive tab updates (realtime);
:Clear form + success snackbar;
:Entry appears in worker Report History\nand admin Receive inbox;
stop
@enduml
